{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32637","headline":"题秦女楼 · 刘沧","name":"题秦女楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠翠香销鸳瓦堕，神仙曾向此中游。\n青楼月色桂花冷，碧落箫声云叶愁。\n杳杳蓬莱人不见，苍苍苔藓路空留。\n一从凤去千年後，迢遰岐山水石秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}